','2026-11-24 12:27:17','2026-11-24 12:27:17'),(1354,23,'Rina: \'You look so pale and exhausted, Dito. What\'s wrong?\' Dito: \'I have a terrible headache because I stayed up late finishing my report.\' Rina: \'_____\' Which expression of suggestion is most appropriate to complete the dialogue?','You must have finished it earlier.','You should take some medicine and get enough rest.','I am sorry to hear about your laptop.','Why don\'t you submit the report next month?','You had better stay up again tonight.','B','2026-11-24 12:27:17','2026-11-24 12:27:17'),(1355,23,'Change the following active sentence into passive voice: \'The engineering team is developing a new solar-powered water pump.\'','A new solar-powered water pump is developed by the engineering team.','A new solar-powered water pump was being developed by the engineering team.','A new solar-powered water pump is being developed by the engineering team.','A new solar-powered water pump has been developed by the engineering team.','A new solar-powered water pump will be developed by the engineering team.','C','2026-11-24 12:27:17','2026-11-24 12:27:17'),(1356,23,'Read the short passage: \'Plastic waste takes hundreds of years to decompose in landfills and oceans, posing a severe threat to marine ecosystems. Microplastics ingested by fish can eventually enter the human food chain.\' What is the main idea of the passage?','Fish are the primary source of protein for humans.','Landfills are the best place to dispose of plastic waste.','Plastic waste threatens marine life and ultimately affects human health.','Marine ecosystems can easily decompose synthetic materials.','Microplastics are beneficial for ocean nutrients.','C','2026-11-24 12:27:17','2026-11-24 12:27:17'),(1357,23,'In a formal application letter, the closing salutation \'Yours faithfully\' is properly used when the recipient\'s name is ...','Known and written as \'Dear Mr. Ahmad\'','A close friend or family member','Unknown and addressed as \'Dear 